# WenQuanYi Zen Hei

`Support/ResourceOverrides/Fonts/KajigeCJKLegacy.ttf` is the proportional
WenQuanYi Zen Hei face from upstream version 0.9.45, saved as a standalone
TrueType font so the 2009 WoW build 12340 renderer does not need TTC support.
No glyph outlines or character mappings were changed.

- Upstream archive:
  `https://downloads.sourceforge.net/wqy/wqy-zenhei-0.9.45.tar.gz`
- Upstream archive SHA-256:
  `e4b7e306475bf9427d1757578f0e4528930c84c44eaa3f167d4c42f110ee75d6`
- Standalone font SHA-256:
  `febf195294b363f3268d954531136ba0d99e9211fe584b07bbd1bd16dad84e8c`
- License: GPL v2 with the font embedding exception described in the bundled
  `README`; the complete upstream GPL text is bundled as `COPYING`.

The standalone file is reproducible with FontTools 4.59.2:

```python
from fontTools.ttLib import TTFont

font = TTFont(
    "wqy-zenhei.ttc",
    fontNumber=0,
    recalcBBoxes=True,
    recalcTimestamp=False,
)
font.save("KajigeCJKLegacy.ttf", reorderTables=False)
```
